{"id":"vod_hh_71389","vodId":"71389","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"兽电战队强龙者 普通话","name_cn":"兽电战队强龙者 普通话","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第48集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/c0d1a45e2391ca3e92684b79affa7dc9.jpg"},"summary":"遥远的恐龙时代，被称为星际病害随着陨石到地球。就连恐龙也被他们消灭。但是有一群幸存下来经由神圣之力而进化的恐龙在历经奋战后，将邪恶首脑冰冻封印拯救地球。之后它们就与贤神托林以及认同的勇者继续守护世界。随着时间的流逝，被封印的宿敌苏醒。面对地球上的生命被消灭的危机，在托林的努力下，五名勇者集结组成队伍，透过寄宿着恐龙灵魂的“兽电池”来驱动的“兽电龙”一同努力对抗邪恶军团！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-27 11:18:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/pen9E3Ed/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/6dBZ0Ekd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKlR08b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penWpX7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejWGvza/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aALm6le/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKoGEYa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZKEl6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0nJ2Xb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejjYJze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddwz2BRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2PE5ve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOjBNBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVqXq1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejmYVPd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDLZN5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOnpvBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKj4Dle/index.m3u8"},{"nam